&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce to manage the sales cycle, pipeline, and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to convey complex ideas clearly and concisely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hunter mentality, with a strong focus on outbound prospecting to build and grow your own pipeline in addition to inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage and build relationships with C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a startup or scale-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why GWI?&lt;/h2&gt;
